~ start
Narrator: "Welcome to Muakbank Zombie! [KYR: Мукбанк Зомбиге кош келиңиз!]"
- "Tell me more" => intro_more
- "Skip the intro" => END

~ intro_more
Narrator: "Feed the zombies before the buffet runs out. [KYR: Бүфөт бүтө электе зомбилерди тойгузуңуз.]"
- "How do I move?" => how_move
- "How do I fight?" => how_fight
- "Let's play!" => END

~ how_move
Narrator: "Use the joystick on the left to move, the camera drag to look around. [KYR: Сол жактагы джойстик менен кыймылдаңыз.]"
- "Got it, and fighting?" => how_fight
- "Let's play!" => END

~ how_fight
Narrator: "Tap the attack button to swing at zombies, and collect food to heal. [KYR: Зомбилерге кол салыңыз жана азык жыйнап ден соолукту калыбына келтириңиз.]"
- "Perfect, let's play!" => END
